<title>PAKISTAN: Pakistani cotton yarn rates close steady.</title>
<headline>Pakistani cotton yarn rates close steady.</headline>
<dateline>KARACHI, Pakistan 1996-12-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Pakistani cotton yarn rates closed steady on Sunday in line with the recent stability of domestic cotton prices, dealers said. Rates were likely to remain stable until Wednesday, they added.</p>
<p>Following are the rates in rupees supplied by the Pakistan Yarn Merchants Association for 10-lb (4.54 kg) cone of 21 counts:			    Sunday     Dec 11</p>
<p>    Al-Karam		     500	   500</p>
<p>    Globe			  500	   500</p>
<p>    MGM			    490	   490</p>
<p>-- Karachi newsroom 9221-5685192</p>
